# Onboarding UI (Figma)

When restyling onboarding pages:

- **Style only** — do not change selection, validation, save, or navigation behavior.
- **Keep responsive** — preserve mobile/desktop breakpoints; use fluid widths with max-widths (e.g. `max-w-[649px]`).
- **Do not change copy** unless the user asks; restyle existing labels/titles.
- **No hardcoded images** — use DB URLs (`icon`, `image_url`, medicine `imageSrc`). Gray placeholder if missing. Never invent stock photos.
- **Logo** — centered; body cone color `#152A51` (same as Figma navy).
- **No Call us / EN** in the header unless the user asks for them.

## Theme tokens

- Navy text: `#152A51` (muted `opacity-80` / `opacity-40` for placeholders)
- CTA: `#E3E084` pill (`h-[46px]`, `rounded-full`, navy text)
- Inputs: `#E8EEED` fill, `h-[45px]`, `rounded-[14px]`, no heavy border
- Labels: `14px` regular, ~`10px` (`space-y-2.5`) above inputs
- Titles: ~`32px` medium, `tracking-[-0.5px]`, Google Sans Flex via `.onboarding-font`
- Accent/check: `#6A9B9C`
- Save badge: bg `#E0FAE8`, text `#34845F`, `12px` medium uppercase
- Promo chip: text `#786C46` when from DB data only

## Goal cards

- Image ~203×231, radius ~12px
- All sharp until a valid selection; then non-selected get ~15px blur; selected stays clear
